  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Seeds and Rural Livelihoods</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. To make available and accessible various types of locally produced good quality seeds for rural communities
2. To develop community gene banks to stock various types of seeds that are vulnerable to extinction due to adverse environmental factors such as drought
3. To support the development and management of a community led seed delivery system that meets the needs of community members</narrative>
  </description>
